<title>USA: Paradise Valley, Ariz., schools won by Merrill.</title>
<headline>Paradise Valley, Ariz., schools won by Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said Thursday it won $38.6 million Paradise Valley Unified School District No 69, Ariz., bonds at a net interest cost of 5.475 percent.</p>
